{"chars": "Where did all those orchids come from? Some were Christmas presents from Santa, who always seems to know exactly which orchid she has been hoping for. Some came from orchid growers, people who raise orchids in their own greenhouses, so that nobody ever needs to take one from the wild. Some she traded with friends from her orchid club, the Alaska Orchid Society, far to the south, where the members grow orchids under lights through the long, dark Alaskan winters, just like she does. They are always delighted when Mrs. Claus arrives by sleigh with a tin of cookies and a new plant to share. And a few, her very proudest, she grew herself from seed, which took years and years of patience.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 2.05, 2.163, 2.163, 2.163, 2.163, 2.163, 2.388, 2.388, 2.388, 2.388, 2.388, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.538, 3.538, 3.538, 3.538, 3.538, 3.538, 4.225, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.775, 4.775, 4.775, 4.775, 4.775, 4.775, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.15, 5.15, 5.15, 5.15, 5.15, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.888, 5.888, 5.888, 5.888, 5.888, 5.888, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.475, 6.475, 6.475, 6.475, 6.588, 6.588, 6.588, 6.588, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 6.7, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.9, 8.037, 8.037, 8.037, 8.037, 8.037, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.3, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.875, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 9.975, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.425, 10.425, 10.425, 10.425, 10.425, 10.425, 10.762, 1